 src/everything/README.md         |  4 ++++
 src/filesystem/README.md         |  2 ++
 src/memory/README.md             |  2 ++
 src/sequentialthinking/README.md |  2 ++
 5 files changed, 19 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

